  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;are the vertices of a quadrilateral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math>. If its area is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math> square units, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
