  "correctValue": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Area of quadrilateral&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>24</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>24</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>90</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1296</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1152</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>90</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Since,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p>",
